{"docstore/data": {"checkout_service_runbook.md::chunk_0": {"__data__": {"id_": "checkout_service_runbook.md::chunk_0", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"chunk_index": 0, "source_filename": "checkout_service_runbook.md", "source_suffix": ".md", "char_count": 291, "section_title": "Checkout Service Runbook", "section_path": ["Checkout Service Runbook"], "heading_level": 1}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "# Checkout Service Runbook\n\n## Service Scope\n\nThe checkout service is responsible for cart validation, order submission,\nshipping quote retrieval, and handoff to payment-service. Checkout problems\ncan create abandoned carts even when payment processing itself is healthy.\n\n## Common Symptoms", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": null, "end_char_idx": null, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "checkout_service_runbook.md::chunk_1": {"__data__": {"id_": "checkout_service_runbook.md::chunk_1", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"chunk_index": 1, "source_filename": "checkout_service_runbook.md", "source_suffix": ".md", "char_count": 332, "section_title": "Common Symptoms", "section_path": ["Checkout Service Runbook", "Common Symptoms"], "heading_level": 2}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "Typical checkout-service problems include cart submission timeout, stale\ninventory state, promo validation failure, and elevated retry loops from the\nfrontend. Search results about checkout incidents often mention session token\nexpiry, cart recalculation, order preview latency, and production checkout\ndegradation.\n\n## Triage Steps", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": null, "end_char_idx": null, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "checkout_service_runbook.md::chunk_2": {"__data__": {"id_": "checkout_service_runbook.md::chunk_2", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"chunk_index": 2, "source_filename": "checkout_service_runbook.md", "source_suffix": ".md", "char_count": 342, "section_title": "Triage Steps", "section_path": ["Checkout Service Runbook", "Triage Steps"], "heading_level": 2}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "1. Confirm whether customers fail before or after the payment handoff.\n2. Check whether the production issue reproduces in staging with the same cart\n   shape.\n3. Inspect retry loops caused by the frontend or the order preview endpoint.\n4. Verify whether inventory or promotion services are causing timeout\n   cascades.\n\n## Ticketing Guidance", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": null, "end_char_idx": null, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "checkout_service_runbook.md::chunk_3": {"__data__": {"id_": "checkout_service_runbook.md::chunk_3", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"chunk_index": 3, "source_filename": "checkout_service_runbook.md", "source_suffix": ".md", "char_count": 361, "section_title": "Ticketing Guidance", "section_path": ["Checkout Service Runbook", "Ticketing Guidance"], "heading_level": 2}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "Create a medium or high severity ticket depending on cart abandonment impact.\nIf checkout fails before payment-service is called, do not classify the issue\nas a payment outage. Attach supporting snippets about cart timeout, promotion\nvalidation, or session expiry so responders can distinguish it from settlement\nor authorization incidents.\n\n## Mitigation Notes", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": null, "end_char_idx": null, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "checkout_service_runbook.md::chunk_4": {"__data__": {"id_": "checkout_service_runbook.md::chunk_4", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"chunk_index": 4, "source_filename": "checkout_service_runbook.md", "source_suffix": ".md", "char_count": 314, "section_title": "Mitigation Notes", "section_path": ["Checkout Service Runbook", "Mitigation Notes"], "heading_level": 2}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "Short-term mitigation may include disabling an expensive promotion rule,\nreducing cart recomputation frequency, or routing order preview traffic to a\ndegraded-mode path. Recovery should be confirmed with cart submit latency and\ncheckout conversion metrics, not just payment success rate.\n\n## Keywords For Retrieval", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": null, "end_char_idx": null, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "checkout_service_runbook.md::chunk_5": {"__data__": {"id_": "checkout_service_runbook.md::chunk_5", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"chunk_index": 5, "source_filename": "checkout_service_runbook.md", "source_suffix": ".md", "char_count": 199, "section_title": "Keywords For Retrieval", "section_path": ["Checkout Service Runbook", "Keywords For Retrieval"], "heading_level": 2}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "This document intentionally uses checkout-service, cart submission, order\npreview, promo validation, inventory timeout, and abandoned cart so it remains\ndistinct from payment-service runbook content.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": null, "end_char_idx": null, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}}, "docstore/metadata": {"checkout_service_runbook.md::chunk_0": {"doc_hash": "82ff87e7528d395949fae90b00c1ed623ca44e860a116729315b59dfd7ed61f7"}, "checkout_service_runbook.md::chunk_1": {"doc_hash": "9ec8386a5beff476000bfc2dcc5f50c1a2198dd317351ae72d59222f8524b0b1"}, "checkout_service_runbook.md::chunk_2": {"doc_hash": "e1bbab98233b38cd6b1ce6dcb33b5a8af16243b982bb9557adbe95ee7866f808"}, "checkout_service_runbook.md::chunk_3": {"doc_hash": "7df857c42f04ed54f9b2925213589eb472c65ac8c5f1a2b0c511f499076680d3"}, "checkout_service_runbook.md::chunk_4": {"doc_hash": "f08ca74f2f82fc60254e9d51f0bafd75bd5c68bcbb69420ed17eeb435b2b2bd7"}, "checkout_service_runbook.md::chunk_5": {"doc_hash": "bc0b3b8b30cd97014078d0550ce80547e7f196f78707edb2dc0e115766e3bac1"}}}